Subject: [PATCH] ACS: reach the BSS fallback when survey is unsupported

The native RTL_AX_AP driver supports mac80211 software scans but has no
get_survey callback. Do not abort before the existing BSS-based ACS fallback
can inspect the scan results. Keep other survey errors fatal.

--- a/src/ap/acs.c
+++ b/src/ap/acs.c
@@ -1462,7 +1462,10 @@ static void acs_scan_complete(struct hostapd_iface *iface)
 		eloop_cancel_timeout(acs_scan_wait_timeout, ifaces[i], NULL);
 	}

-	if (err) {
+	if (err == -EOPNOTSUPP) {
+		wpa_printf(MSG_INFO,
+			   "ACS: Survey unavailable, using BSS-based fallback");
+	} else if (err) {
 		wpa_printf(MSG_ERROR, "ACS: Failed to get survey data");
 		for (i = 0; i < n; i++)
 			acs_scan_failed(ifaces[i]);
